            HAI 1.3
              O HAI IM box
                HOW IZ I direct
                  VISIBLE "direct"
                IF U SAY SO
              KTHX
              O HAI IM root
                O HAI IM child
                  HOW IZ I nested
                    VISIBLE "nested"
                  IF U SAY SO
                KTHX
              KTHX
              I HAS A scopeName ITZ "box"
              I HAS A childName ITZ "child"
              I HAS A functionName ITZ "nested"
              SRS scopeName IZ direct MKAY
              root'Z SRS childName IZ SRS functionName MKAY
            KTHXBYE
            
